king</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.61<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">August 23, 2010</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20161006092850&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Energy_Gate_571789.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see an energy gate.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>In the <a href=\"#/wiki/Raging%20Mage\">Raging Mage</a> Tower and the <a href=\"#/wiki/Yielothax%20Dimension\">Yielothax Dimension</a> if the latter is accessible. When the <a href=\"#/quest/rise-of-devovorga\">Rise of Devovorga</a> event is active, they can also be found between Skull Pillars all over <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia\">Tibia</a> and in all lairs of the bosses related to this event. In addition, one is located in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Realm%20of%20Dreams\">Realm of Dreams</a>. There's also one in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Halls%20of%20Hope\">Halls of Hope</a>. Four energy gates can be seen at Travora's platform, although they are unreachable.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n